=\\frac{1}{A+x}$ is the solution to this initial value problem. What is the value of the constant $A?$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397912 1072 #uuid "ea6ff592-81a4-59f3-84d6-c97bdc2e3a4f" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397912 1074 "We're given that $y=\\frac{1}{A+x}$ is the solution to the initial value problem. Therefore, it must satisfy the differential equation *and* the initial condition $y(0)=\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nSubstituting the initial condition $y(0)=\\frac{1}{2}$ into our solution and solving for $A,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{1}{A+x} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & =\\frac{1}{A+0} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & =\\frac{1}{A} \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2+x}.\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397914 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397915 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397916 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397917 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397918 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397916 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397913 1080 #uuid "9f0c471e-3bc9-5406-b7a8-dfcd6f763630" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397914 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397914 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397914 1084 #uuid "2dcefcd7-21a2-550b-82e1-cdf9e8efcbda" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397915 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397915 1084 #uuid "4b42