n$$\nT=\\frac{\\pi }{B}.\n$$\n\nApplying the formula of the period, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi }{4}=\\frac{\\pi }{B}\\,⟹\\,B=\\frac{\\pi }{(\\frac{\\pi }{4})}=4.\n$$\n\nThe parameter $D$ represents the vertical shift of the cotangent function. We see that the function has been translated by $\\frac{9}{4}$ unit down. Therefore, $D=-\\frac{9}{4}.$\n\nTherefore, $B-2D=4-2\\cdot (-\\frac{9}{4})=4+\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{17}{2}.$  \n\nFinally, the equation of the curve is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(4x)-\\frac{9}{4}.\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397935 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397936 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397937 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397938 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397939 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397939 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397934 1080 #uuid "a33bc7f4-158e-59b4-b555-27008daa9757" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397935 1081 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397935 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397935 1084 #uuid "6f9abc86-74e1-5d19-8f4f-0f0e7a56d821" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397936 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397936 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397936 1084 #uuid "ab992999-a43c-5b0c-874e-f97040b58cc0" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397937 1081 "\\frac{13}{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397937 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397937 1084 #uuid "d0aa5750-a42b