}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice we are told that the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}=⟨v,\\,-1,\\,u⟩.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =⟨xz,\\,y,\\,xz⟩{|}_{x=u\\,y=uv\\,z=v} \\\\  & =⟨uv,\\,uv,\\,uv⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨uv,\\,uv,\\,uv⟩\\cdot ⟨v,\\,-1,\\,u⟩ \\\\  & =uv\\cdot v+uv\\cdot (-1)+uv\\cdot u \\\\  & =u{v}^{2}-uv+{u}^{2}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,u{v}^{2}-uv+{u}^{2}v\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397989 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397990 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397991 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397992 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397993 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397993 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397988 1080 #uuid "af2f16f5-115b-5596-b71d-8a4dab14117a" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397989 1081 "{u}^{2}v" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397989 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397989 1084 #uuid "9f13cf51-1f17-54c3-b3d0-3a4ed9f6cc76" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397990 1081 "u{v}^{2}-{u}^{2}v" 13194139533472 17592186045585 tru