#uuid "894e1641-4cda-5256-a33c-65967a2846fc" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398045 1081 "3" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398045 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398045 1084 #uuid "99ff0bee-2eb2-50e8-87cd-b7fd103093fe" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398046 1081 "6" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398046 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398046 1084 #uuid "72a9aeba-e4a8-5fb4-952f-d24c797294fd" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398047 1081 "2\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398047 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398047 1084 #uuid "dd6ec8be-4e28-5339-a7f2-8fd7158128e6" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398048 1081 "4" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398048 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398048 1084 #uuid "921a96a5-579d-5f70-be47-3cf461114085" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398049 1081 "3\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398049 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398049 1084 #uuid "960900f4-7e67-5f08-869d-467271a2c7e8" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1068 #edb/ref 17592186398051 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1069 "q-164412" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1071 "The projection of the intersection between the parabolic cylinder $3(x+2)^{2}=6(y+3)$ and the plane $z=4$ onto the $xy$-plane is a parabola. What is the vertex of the parabola?" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1072 #uuid "75aa15a4-a235-5132-bf56-78143897ca7d" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398050 1074 "To find the intersection of the cylinder and the plane $z=4,$ we substitute $z=4$ into the equation of the cylinder. However, since the equation has no (explicit) $z$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(x+2)^{2} & =6(y+3) \\\\ (x+2)^{2} & =2(y+3) \\\\ (x+2)^{2} & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (y+3).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a parabola in the $xy$-plane with the vertex at $(-2,-3).$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398052 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398053 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398054 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398055 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398056 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398055 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398051 1080 #uuid "79567a05-b827-5460-9e1f-fb9fcfce3867" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398052 1081 "(-3,2)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398052 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398052 1084 #uuid "e422031f-1484-5bc6-8b3c-a582a65649b5" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1081 "(4,-3)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1084 #uuid "cb516869-a543-5bb4-a49a-1d6a41dfce68" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1081 "(2,3)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1084 #uuid "1b1a5a20-c7b4-5185-92b5-163b7a139d28" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1081 "(-2,-3)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1084 #uuid "6feba394-c3ca-5316-a6b7-e7c023aefbf2" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1081 "(-2,4)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1084 #uuid "d8d770c7-1de6-53fa-b478-f0ede460b35e" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1068 #edb/ref 17592186398058 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1069 "q-165039" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1071 "Given the curve $r(t)=⟨\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}+4t,3{t}^{2}+9t⟩,$ find the point at which the tangent to the curve is parallel to the vector $⟨1,3⟩.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1072 #uuid "29b73a1c-11c1-5790-9fa9-ce94ade43d27" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1074 "First, we calculate the derivative of $r(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}+4t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2}+9t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3t+4,6t+9⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $⟨0\\,,\\,1\\,,\\,3⟩$ are parallel for some specific value ${t}_{0}$ of the parameter $t$ if and only if there exists a constant $c$ such that ${r}^{′}({t}_{0})=c⟨1,3⟩.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =c⟨1,3⟩ \\\\ ⟨3t+4,6t+9⟩ & =c⟨1,3⟩ \\\\ ⟨3t+4,6t+9⟩ & =⟨c,3c⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the components gives:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3t+4=c \\\\ 6t+9=3c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we obtain that $c=3t+4.$ Substituting $c=3t+4$ into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6t+9 & =3(3t+4) \\\\ 6t+9 & =9t+12 \\\\ 3t & =-3 \\\\ t & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $⟨1,3⟩$ and ${r}^{′}$ are parallel only at the point corresponding to $t=-1.$\n\nFinally, since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(-1) & =⟨\\frac{3}{2}(-1)^{2}+4(-1),3(-1)^{2}+9(-1)⟩=⟨-\\frac{5}{2},-6⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe conclude that $⟨1,3⟩$ and ${r}^{′}(t)$ are parallel at the point $(-\\frac{5}{2},-6).$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398059 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398060 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398061 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398062 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398063 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398062 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1080 #uuid "7805dc28-4db0-584d-a7f0-aae461b099c2" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398059 1081 "(14,30)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398059 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398059 1084 #uuid "26585b8c-e264-5ec5-9955-637ca3eab6f6" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398060 1081 "$(0,0)$ and $(\\frac{11}{2},12)$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398060 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398060 1084 #uuid "8ffd5745-f4c8-5a19-adc0-b37920b54995" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398061 1081 "(\\frac{11}{2},12)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398061 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398061 1084 #uuid "5225db26-fbee-5e92-ab23-1c2785ab7665" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398062 1081 "(-\\frac{5}{2},-6)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398062 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398062 1084 #uuid "de5685b5-e86e-5a26-8d7a-36145d147fe5" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398063 1081 "$(0,0)$ and $(-\\frac{5}{2},-6)$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [175921